Author:     Brendan Abolivier <brendan@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Mon Feb 17 16:11:17 2025 +0000
Commit:     Brendan Abolivier <brendan@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Mon Feb 17 16:11:17 2025 +0000

    Bug 1927877 - Download EWS messages in an nsIChannel. r=BenC,mkmelin


    This patch introduces the `OfflineStorage` files in `mailnews/protocols/common`,
    which are meant as protocol-agnostic helpers for reading a message from an
    offline store (since the logic for this doesn't really need to be
    protocol-specific).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236155

